[agent:result] # MAGIC %md
[agent:result] # Fraud FTI Pipeline (DLT)
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] This notebook defines a Delta Live Table (DLT) pipeline for:
[agent:result] 1. Feature engineering into `cctxne0b071`.
[agent:result] 2. Training dataset `cctde0b071`.
[agent:result] 3. Model `ccmodele0b071`.
